ent-ClothingHeadHelmetEVA = EVA 頭盔 | EVA helmet
    .desc = 一款專為太空行走設計、雖舊卻經典的頭盔。因常讓安保人員感到疑神疑鬼而臭名昭著。 | An old-but-gold helmet designed for extravehicular activites. Infamous for making security officers paranoid.
ent-ClothingHeadHelmetEVALarge = 緊急用安全帽 | emergency helmet
    .desc = 很難相信這件看起來很廉價的東西竟然是氣密的，但事實確實如此。 | Hard to believe this cheap-looking thing is airtight, but it is.
